"[code]arm32[/code], and [code]arm64[/code] binaries only."
msgstr ""
"程式可執行檔架構。\n"
"支援的架構有：[code]x86_32[/code]、[code]x86_64[/code]、[code]arm64[/code]、"
"[code]arm32[/code]、[code]rv64[/code]、[code]ppc64[/code]、[code]loongarch64[/"
"code]。\n"
